      "summary": {
        "text": "Enzo Deligny (born 17 April 2008) is a French and Chinese racing driver who is set to compete in the FIA Formula 3 Championship for Van Amersfoort Racing.\n\nA member of the Red Bull Junior Team from 2023 to 2024, Deligny raced in the 2023 F4 Spanish Championship, finishing fourth overall. He progressed to Formula Regional European in 2024, finishing third in 2025 with R-ace GP.",
