      "summary": {
        "text": "Sage Rennie Karam (born March 5, 1995) is an American professional auto racing driver. He last competed part-time in the NASCAR O'Reilly Auto Parts Series, driving the No. 55 Toyota GR Supra for Joey Gase Motorsports with Scott Osteen, and part-time in the ARCA Menards Series West, driving the No. 72 Chevrolet for Strike Mamba Racing. He previously competed full-time and part-time in the IndyCar Series. He is the 2013 champion in what is now the Indy NXT Series.",
        "lang": "en",
        "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sage_Karam"
